  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 405.07 Final Inspection Report.\n\n(a) The engineer shall submit an inspection report to the department within 60 days of the completion of the project.\n\n(b) The report shall include:\n\n(1) A copy of all test results;\n\n(2) The engineer’s and agent’s, if one or more are employed, observations of the work items specified in Env-Wr 405.05;\n\n(3) Summary of weekly progress reports for all inspections, including representative photographs;\n\n(4) Documentation of all department-approved changes in design;\n\n(5) Foundation conditions observed during excavation; and\n\n(6) Any other data pertinent to determining the integrity of the structure, including unexpected conditions or unusual circumstances observed during the project.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #5080, eff 2-22-91; rpld by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 405.08)",
